1
00:00:03,474 --> 00:00:11,575
Three simulated drones, all trusted.

2
00:00:11,575 --> 00:00:15,144
uav2's position froze. The system flags it RED and says why.

3
00:00:15,144 --> 00:00:18,646
It recommends landing uav2. It cannot act on its own.

4
00:00:18,646 --> 00:00:23,608
Nothing moves until a person approves.

5
00:00:23,608 --> 00:00:29,762
Approved by Duty operator. The decision and the name are recorded in the audit log.
